  "skillsPrompt": "\n\nThe following skills provide specialized instructions for specific tasks.\nUse the read tool to load a skill's file when the task matches its description.\nWhen a skill file references a relative path, resolve it against the skill directory (parent of SKILL.md / dirname of the path) and use that absolute path in tool commands.\n\n<available_skills>\n  <skill>\n    <name>browser-automation</name>\n    <description>Use when controlling web pages with the OpenClaw browser tool, especially multi-step flows, login checks, tab management, or recovery from stale refs/timeouts.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/plugin-skills/browser-automation/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>research-analyst</name>\n    <description>通用调研执行技能。将输入主题或资料转为证据包、洞察图谱和风险假设，可复用于 PPT/报告/方案类流程。</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace-research/skills/research-analyst/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>web-browse-capture</name>\n    <description>Use OpenClaw browser profiles to browse, click, paginate, expand, and extract data from real webpages through a live browser. Trigger when a task needs true browser interaction rather than plain search or static fetch, such as JS-rendered pages, login-gated views, button clicks, pagination, dropdowns, tab switching, dynamic tables, or step-by-step website operations. Also trigger when the user wants to visit a specific website and collect/extract images, text, or data from it. Typical requests include: 去某个网站抓数据, 从网页抓图片, 去Pinterest抓图, 爬取网页内容, 点进这个网站抓数据, 翻页把列表都扒下来, 进后台网页操作并提取字段, 动态网页读取, 真实浏览器访问网页, browser-use 网页采集, 用浏览器进去看, 帮我去XX上抓/爬/采集, or 打开网页提取信息.</description>\n    <location>~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/web-browse-capture/SKILL.md</location>\n  </skill>\n</available_skills>",
